@CO	typed: every aux type. XC:i:-5 is stored as c, XI:i:3000000000 as I, XB is B:c, BF is B:f.
@CO	rev: flag 16, two CG calls (G positions), to show row order along the strand and strand '-'.
@CO	badtext: XZ:Z holds byte 0xFF (not UTF-8): parquet stops without --permissive, null + counted with it.
@CO	nohit: a mapped read with no CG: one hitless row.
@CO	unmapped: flag 4 with tags: one hitless row, record columns still filled.
